<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CompDent Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CompDent Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of CompDent Corp as outperform and set a price target of $40 a share.</p>
<p>-- CompDent gained 1-1/2 to 29 in early trading.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
